  "description": "“Continue that seductive act you were doing. It’ll be easier than before, since you’ll be doing it with me.” \n\nCordelia, the daughter of Baron Lawrence, was known to the world as the first love of Grand Duke Calix. However, the only reason she could become the Grand Duchess was due to a contract she signed to protect her younger sibling. But according to local customs, witnesses must observe the couple on their wedding night… \n\n“Your Grace, you seem uncomfortable… I will take the lead.”\n\n With only a thin curtain separating them from the watching witnesses, Cordelia had to moan and writhe against the Grand Duke’s body. When the Grand Duke, who had been lying perfectly still, suddenly opened his eyes, she had to prove her worth despite her trembling fear. But the words he spoke were strange. \n\n“If you’ve managed to stir me up, you should take responsibility.” \n\nA dangerous and dizzying transaction. Will Cordelia truly be able to survive the end of this contract marriage?\n\n[Original Webtoon](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=14360895)",
